Actually, there's a very cool but perhaps little-known
feature to merge items: pick the same letter twice when
using #adjust, and all items that will merge with the item
in that slot.  So if you have:

e - 2 clear potions
f - 2 clear potions
g - a clear potion

and do #adjust ee, you'll end up with

e - 5 clear potions

I use this all the time when I'm uncursing items, or if 
I've been blanking scrolls and diluting potions.  It's
easier than adjusting them manually or doing the drop/
pickup routine.

